msgstr ""
"Skrip yang sama dibungkus dalam idiom pernyataan :keyword:`with` dari "
":doc:`socket-objects`\\ , sehingga socket ditutup meskipun ada sesuatu yang "
"menyebabkan pengecualian::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/tcp-sockets.rst:53
msgid "Reading until done"
msgstr "Membaca hingga selesai"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/tcp-sockets.rst:55
msgid ""
"A single :meth:`~socket.socket.recv` returns *up to* the requested number of"
" bytes -- it can return fewer, because TCP is a stream rather than a "
"sequence of messages. The application has to keep reading until it has the "
"full reply::"
msgstr ""
"Satu :meth:`~socket.socket.recv` mengembalikan *hingga* jumlah byte yang "
"diminta -- bisa mengembalikan lebih sedikit, karena TCP adalah stream bukan "
"urutan pesan. Aplikasi harus terus membaca hingga mendapatkan balasan "
"lengkap::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/tcp-sockets.rst:69
msgid ""
"The loop ends when :meth:`~socket.socket.recv` returns an empty "
":class:`bytes`. That happens when the other side has cleanly closed its half"
" of the connection; the application reads \"end of stream\" as the same as "
"\"end of message\" in this style of protocol."
msgstr ""
"Loop berakhir ketika :meth:`~socket.socket.recv` mengembalikan "
":class:`bytes` kosong. Hal itu terjadi ketika sisi lain telah menutup "
"setengah koneksinya dengan bersih; aplikasi membaca \"akhir stream\" sebagai"
" sama dengan \"akhir pesan\" dalam gaya protokol ini."

